Trello

Your new hires will ❤️ this employee onboarding checklist
 
The first 90 days can make or break a position for a new employee. Welcome newbies onto the team with an onboarding experience they'll appreciate long after their first few months.
 
Checklist, check!
>> https://blog.trello.com/employee-onboarding-checklist-and-templates?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-may2023-newsletter1_EML-15683&jobid=106062380&subid=1751586021&send_date=5/16/2023
 
 
ICYMI: everything you need to know from TEAM '23 
 
Missed us at TEAM '23? Or perhaps you're ready to relive all the Trello excitement? Either way, here's everything you need to know from Atlassian's annual flagship event.
 
Get caught up
>> https://blog.trello.com/enterprise/team-23?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-may2023-newsletter1_EML-15683&jobid=106062380&subid=1751586021&send_date=5/16/2023
 
 
One (admin) hub to rule them all
 
Trello admins rejoice! With the latest updates to Atlassian Administration, you can now manage all of your Atlassian products – including Trello – in one intuitive hub. 
 
Game changer
>> https://blog.trello.com/trello-admin-hub-updates?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-may2023-newsletter1_EML-15683&jobid=106062380&subid=1751586021&send_date=5/16/2023
 
 
Better feedback = better outcomes
 
Feedback is crucial for quality work. But the collection process can be full of frustrations and inefficiencies. Don't worry, though! We've got just the thing: sparring.
 
Teach me how
>> https://blog.trello.com/the-art-of-sparring-for-team-feedback?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-may2023-newsletter1_EML-15683&jobid=106062380&subid=1751586021&send_date=5/16/2023
 
 
Join the Work Management Community Group
 
Learn and share tips, tricks, and new ways to use Confluence, Trello, Atlas, and other tools for Work Management in this new community group.
 
Join now
>> https://community.atlassian.com/t5/Work-Management/gh-p/work-management?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-may2023-newsletter1_EML-15683&jobid=106062380&subid=1751586021&send_date=5/16/2023
 
